    <title>Contact-Rich Manipulation Needs High-Frequency Feedback</title>
    <summary>We study fine-grained contact-rich manipulation. We find that scaling demonstrations with a fixed low-frequency action chunk saturates, while closing the loop on force feedback at high frequency keeps improving.</summary>
